        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "PROBLEM 2A-6SHOCKLOADS ONFRANGIBLE ELEMENTS ",
            "block_bbox": [
                239,
                283,
                943,
                304
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Problem:Determine the average peak reflected pressure and average reflected impulse acting on the frangible wall of a cubicle due to an internal explosion.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                342,
                1043,
                419
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Procedure:",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                441,
                263,
                462
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 1.Determine the average peak reflected pressure P, and the average reflected impulse acting on the element in question according to the procedure in Problem 2A-4, assuming that the wall will remain intact.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                485,
                987,
                563
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 2.Calculate the unit weight of the frangible element W and divide by the sixth root of the charge weight (apply a 20% factor of safety to the charge weight).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                582,
                1036,
                660
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 3.From Figure 2-7 (+) determine the fictitious scaled distance Z which corresponds to the average scaled impulse determined in Step 1.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                680,
                978,
                731
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 4.Using the value of W/W1/6 from Step 2 and the Z from Step 3,determine the reflection factor f,from Figure 2-150 (+). Interpolate for value of Z if required.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                751,
                1029,
                828
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 5.a.Calculate the value of the average impulse contributing to the translation of the frangible element by multiplying the values of ir and f, of Steps 1 and 4 respectively.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                851,
                1014,
                927
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.The peak average reflected pressure of the shock load is equal to the value of P, in Step 1.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                273,
                948,
                1026,
                998
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C.Determine the duration of the load from Equation 2-2.",
            "block_bbox": [
                274,
                1020,
                900,
                1043
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
            "block_content": "2A-24",
            "block_bbox": [
                567,
                1517,
                630,
                1537
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": null
        }
    ],
